usage: plan.py reopen [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --reason REASON
                      [--actor ACTOR]
                      plan item

reopen a finished item (owner amendment)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  item

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --reason REASON
  --actor ACTOR         PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT] (default: the item executor,
                        else plan authoring)
